%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Web
    participant API
    participant Market as Market Data Module
    participant Binance
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Web->>API: SUBSCRIBE_CANDLES(pair, timeframe)
    API->>Market: subscribeCandles(query, handler)
    Market->>Binance: Open or reuse upstream stream
    Binance-->>Market: Kline update
    Market->>Market: Normalize + order + deduplicate
    Market-->>API: Candle + connection state
    API-->>Web: CANDLE_UPDATED
    Binance--xMarket: Disconnect
    Market-->>API: RECONNECTING
    loop Bounded exponential backoff with jitter
        Market->>Binance: Reconnect
    end
    Market->>Binance: Backfill from last confirmed candle
    Binance-->>Market: Missing or overlapping candles
    Market->>Market: Sort + deduplicate + gap check
    Market->>DB: Persist closed candles idempotently
    Market-->>API: Recovered updates + CONNECTED
    API-->>Web: Snapshot/delta + connection state
